    {
      "id": "tf20-sec-txt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1868,
      "y": 174,
      "width": 121,
      "height": 404,
      "text": "🔒 SÉCURITÉ &\nPERFORMANCE\n\n1. Zéro CDN\nGoogle Fonts :\n100% .woff2\nlocales dans\nl'app.\n\n2. CSP stricte :\nfont-src 'self'\nconnect-src\n'none'.\n\n3. 0 ms FOUT :\nchargement\ninstantané\nhors-ligne.\n\n4. Repli auto\n15 langues :\nJA / KO / ZH\nRU / UK / TH.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#a7f3d0",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
